config RTL8139
    tristate "Realtek RTL8139 10/100 PCI Ethernet (classic mode)"
    default y
    help
      Native driver for PCI 10ec:8139, including the QEMU RTL8139 model.
      Uses the I/O BAR, DMA32 receive ring and four transmit buffers, with
      task-context polling and device interrupts masked. Each PCI function
      registers a separate interface. M builds rtl8139.ko for this kernel.
      C+ descriptor mode, hardware offloads and shared INTx are not enabled.
